# Degrade, don't dead-end: if the `prompt` binary is missing from the card, the App falls
# back to the auto-sync-on-open behaviour instead of a blank screen.
desc app menu: prompt binary missing -> auto-sync fallback, no menu
invoke app
config paired
wifi up
no-prompt
engine 0|MIRROR created=1 updated=0\nRESULT ok
expect_exit 0
expect_trace_absent PROMPT[
expect_trace ENGINE --mirror-catalog
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Sync complete'
expect_log prompt picker not found
